      "widgets_values": [
        "tracking shot, low angle shot, slow motion, wide-angle lens, high contrast lighting, backlighting, rim lighting, practical lighting, warm colors, cinematic, photorealistic, smoke, fire, fighting, elegant\nA dynamic, low-slung tracking shot keeps pace with a long-haired female agent sprinting at full speed. Ahead of her, a massive, thousand-pound stone door, carved with ancient runes, is closing irrevocably with a deep, rumbling sound. Just a few meters from the closing gate, she throws herself into an incredibly low and powerful slide. At this moment, the scene shifts into extreme slow motion. Her tactical suit grinds against the rough flagstone floor, kicking up a brilliant trail of sparks and a cloud of dust. The strong light from beyond the doorway creates a perfect backlight, casting a sharp rim light around her body and illuminating the flying sparks and debris. At the very last second, with only a hair's breadth of a gap remaining, her body slips through with breathtaking precision. Her long dark hair follows, sweeping across the ground just as the stone door slams shut, completing a spectacular last-second escape."
      ],
